= Relation ledger

Use one stable identifier per relation you want to return to. A row need not begin as a question;
it may begin as a coupling pattern, an apparent invariant, or an unclassified stratum.

#table(
  columns: (auto, 1.2fr, 1fr, 1fr),
  inset: 7pt,
  stroke: 0.5pt + luma(190),
  [*ID*], [*Object / relation*], [*What may vary?*], [*Invariant, obstruction, or next chart*],
  [R1], [$Delta=(a-d)^2+4 b c$], [$b,c$ signs and transport], [Locate the full zero stratum.],
)
